        m_Value: Those you fix yourself, as each says how
    - rid: 552786288315990089
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724798001725441
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Prevent Invalid Moves
    - rid: 552786288315990090
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724798001725442
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moving a point stops short of where it would make a polygon invalid (concave, inside out, crossing itself, or without area) or a line too long. Hold Shift while dragging a point to allow it anyway.
    - rid: 552786288315990120
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288646750208
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Find In Directory
    - rid: 552786288315990121
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288650944512
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Choose a folder to search for the first Maps, Shapes, Physics and Sounds files, looking through shallower subfolders before deeper ones. Files are recognized by their extensions, or (for files without one) by their contents. Any type that isn't found is unloaded.
    - rid: 552786288315990122
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288650944513
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Choose a folder to find files in
